This template shows the general seed drop table.

==Usage==
This template can be used by entering the following onto a relevant page. The first argument is the chance to roll the table. The second argument is the combat level of the monster.

<pre>{{GeneralSeedDropTableInfo|6/128}}
{{DropsTableHead}}
{{GeneralSeedDropLines|6/128|34}}
{{DropsTableBottom}}

You can override the quantity (e.g. 5 at a time):
{{GeneralSeedDropLines|6/128|rolls=5}}

You can set the namenotes to {{(m)}} with the f2p param. This indicates that the monster is also found in f2p areas (not that the drops are available to f2p players).
{{GeneralSeedDropLines|6/128|34|f2p=yes}}</pre>

