{{Invokes|Main article}}

This template can be used to link to another relevant article or set of articles when there is no way to fluently link the article in prose.

;Good example

<pre>
==Strategies==
{{Main|/Strategies}}
Abyssal demons are weak to slash.
</pre>

;Bad example
Below, it makes more sense to simply link [[Guthix]] in the paragraph:
<pre>
==Guthix==
{{Main|Guthix}}
Guthix is a god.
</pre>

{{TemplateData|<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"label": "Article",
			"description": "Article to link to",
			"example": "/Strategies",
			"type": "string",
			"required": true
		}
	},
	"description": "This template can be used to link to another relevant article or set of articles when there is no way to fluently link the article in prose.",
	"format": "inline"
}
</templatedata>
}}

{{Documentation}}

This template creates a box with a button to copy tile markers with links to additional info and the full data.
If Title is omitted, it will default to "Tile Markers".

Full information available at [[RuneScape:Tile markers]].

==Usage==
===Basic===
{| class = "center"
!
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Brutus safespot cycle.json|Brutus safespot cycle}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| class= "center" | {{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Brutus safespot cycle.json|Brutus safespot cycle|align=center}}
|}

===No Preview===
{| class = "center"
!
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Brutus safespot cycle.json|Brutus safespot cycle|align=center|showpreview=no}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| class= "center" | {{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Brutus safespot cycle.json|Brutus safespot cycle|align=center|showpreview=no}}
|}

==[[Module:Map]] passthrough (x,y,zoom,align)==

This template also utilizes [[Template:Map]] via a wrapper module [[Module:Tile markers button]]. See the [[Template:Map#Basics]] for more details on the relevant arguments.

==Arguments==
{{ArgDocHeader}}
{{ArgDocLine
|description = A path to the json page containing the tilemarker data.
|values = Any *.json page containing tilemarker data
|required = Yes
}}
{{ArgDocLine
|description = The x coordinate that the map window should be centered on.
|values = Any text
|default = 'Tile Markers'
}}
{{ArgDocLine
|name = showpreview
|description = A flag to enable or disable the preview map with tile markers rendered on it.
|values = <code>'y', 'yes', 'true'</code> to show a preview, anything else hides the map preview.
|default = true
}}
{{ArgDocLine
|name = x
|description = The x coordinate that the map window should be centered on.
|values = Any number between the bounds of the in-game map x-axis.
|default = Refer to [[Template:Map#Map_location]] documentation for additional details.
|required = false
}}
{{ArgDocLine
|name = y
|description = The y coordinate that the map window should be centered on.
|values = Any number between the bounds of the in-game map x-axis.
|default = Refer to [[Template:Map#Map_location]] documentation for additional details.
}}
{{ArgDocLine
|name = zoom
|description = The zoom level that the map window should use.
|values = Any number between <code>-3</code> and <code>3</code>.
|default = Refer to [[Template:Map#Map_location]] documentation for additional details.
}}
{{ArgDocLine
|name = align
|description = A flag to enable or disable the preview map with tile markers rendered on it.
|values = <code>left</code>, <code>center</code>, or <code>right</code> to align the box
|default = Refer to [[Template:Map#Alignment]] documentation for additional details
}}
{{ArgDocFooter}}

===Test cases===
====Split multiple into different "instances"====
These should not show all 4 packs on the same map
{{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Basic Strategy Tithe Farm.json}}
{{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Tithe Farm (Combo).json}}
{{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Tithe_Farm_23x_Simple_Route.json}}
{{Tile markers box|Module:Tile markers/Tithe Farm (25x4).json}}

